{"id":"39f739a0ae971bf5","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-poset-coatom.md","title":"ZFC Poset Coatom","display":"df-zfc-poset-coatom — ZFC Poset Coatom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-coatom","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-coatom"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-coatom — ZFC Poset Coatom","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-coatom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-coatom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-coatom — ZFC Poset Coatom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"177489951e58f69f\" href=\"?note=177489951e58f69f\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L,c\\in V\">\\(L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L,c\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\\)</span> (bounded-lattice predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"177489951e58f69f\" href=\"?note=177489951e58f69f\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in L\">\\(c\\in L\\)</span> (candidate coatom)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCoatom}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCoatom}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}coatom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetCoatom}_S(c,L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L)\\land c\\in L\\land c\\neq1_L\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\bigl((c\\leq_Lx\\land x\\neq c)\\to x=1_L\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}coatom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetCoatom}_S(c,L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L)\\land c\\in L\\land c\\neq1_L\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\bigl((c\\leq_Lx\\land x\\neq c)\\to x=1_L\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> is a maximal element strictly below the specified top of a typed bounded lattice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"177489951e58f69f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"177489951e58f69f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S$ (bounded-lattice predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCoatom}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}coatom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetCoatom}_S(c,L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L)\\land c\\in L\\land c\\neq1_L\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\bigl((c\\leq_Lx\\land x\\neq c)\\to x=1_L\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false}],"bytes":977,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-poset-coatom.md|58-df-zfc-poset-coatom]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","177489951e58f69f"]}